{"id": 1001764, "slug": "coffee-boobs", "name": "Coffee & Boobs", "name_original": "Coffee & Boobs", "description": "<p><strong>Coffee...</strong> How many amazing adventures have started with a sip of this invigorating beverage! How many spicy stories followed the invitation for a cup of coffee! Now it is hard to imagine the world without it. And the amazing events in the life of our hero began with coffee.</p><p>Join the young man who wants to become an apprentice of the greatest barista in history. Finding himself under the roof of a cozy cafe, our hero will quickly realize that the staff here will steal his heart and settle in his hot dreams for a long time! Who would miss such an opportunity - to fulfill his dream, and even in the company of charming and passionate girls?</p><ul><li><p>Admire the cozy and hospitable visuals</p></li><li><p>Several romantic interests, and only your choice will determine with whom you will have spend the night.</p></li><li><p>A funny and light story with a pinch of drama and coffee flavor</p></li><li><p>Multiple endings dictated by your choices</p></li><li><p>Choose the familiar path or dare to experiment!</p></li><li><p>Be ready for spicy surprises! </p></li><li><p>Brew yourself a coffee and enjoy this story!</p></li></ul>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-04-18", "tba": false, "updated": "2026-04-14T08:06:38", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/686/6862d1d586cec6f393f26ae7f2903d5d.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/bbf/bbffdd0070b36b7b301c6b287ece9b87.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [{"id": 3, "title": "meh", "count": 2, "percent": 50.0}, {"id": 4, "title": "recommended", "count": 1, "percent": 25.0}, {"id": 1, "title": "skip", "count": 1, "percent": 25.0}], "reactions": null, "added": 12, "added_by_status": {"yet": 2, "owned": 3, "beaten": 3, "toplay": 2, "dropped": 1, "playing": 1}, "playtime":